aa sau adhik neh upajaayo ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਉਸ ਨਾਲ ਬਹੁਤ ਪ੍ਰੇਮ ਪੈਦਾ ਕਰ ਲਿਆ"}}},{"verse_id":116791,"page_no":938,"line_no":116791,"gurmukhi":"ਭਾਤਿ ਭਾਤਿ ਸੌ ਮੋਹ ਬਢਾਯੋ ॥੧੮॥","translit_en":"bhaat bhaat sau moh baddaayo ||18||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"She depicted intense love towards him and showered many affections.(18)"},"pu":{"ss":"ਅਤੇ ਭਾਤ ਭਾਤ ਨਾਲ ਮੋਹ ਵਧਾ ਲਿਆ ॥੧੮॥"}}}],"nav":{"prev":10672,"next":10674}}